<title>INDIA: India sees 96/97 manufacturing growth at 10.6 pct.</title>
<headline>India sees 96/97 manufacturing growth at 10.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's manufacturing sector is expected to grow by 10.6 percent in 1996/97 (April-March), Finance Minister P. Chidambaram said on Friday.</p>
</text>
